Process lesson: do not spend the full demo budget automatically. Extract each pair's exact changed coordinates, compare with all unchanged candidate runs, and formulate a measurable selector (e.g., a bar ending short of the right boundary versus full-width bars) before another request. Even when a rule is evident, validate the predicted row and exact suffix length against every demo. Keep the session-specific rule as evidence, not as a universal task-ID mapping.", "file_type": ".md", "_source_path": "/home/USER/continual-arc-baselines/.workbench/stage1/H-hermes-luna6-low-ws0/frozen/seen-4/play/users/u016/system/state/hermes/skills/puzzle-solving/arc-task-delta-inference/references/task-29b1b5eb-edge-extension.md"}
